CHAPTER.VERS:
The high places also of 

          This he speaks in contempt of Bethel. {{See Hos_4:15}}
         Aven, the sin of Israel, shall be destroyed: the thorn and the thistle shall come up on their altars; and they shall say to the mountains, Cover us; and to the hills, Fall on us.

Sow to yourselves in righteousness, reap in mercy; 

          {{See Jer_4:3}}
         break up your fallow ground: for [it is] time to seek the LORD, till he come and rain righteousness upon you.
